William,

It is unlikely.  The UUID is a 128 bit quantity that is guaranteed to be 
unique, and is generated by combining time, a random seed, and the MACID 
of a machine.
See more about it at: http://www.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9629399/apdxa.htm

regards,
Rich



